<!-- ============================================================
     1. HERO SECTION
============================================================ -->
<section class="inner-page-hero digest-hero">
  <div class="inner-page-hero-inner">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">About STIAM</span>
    <h1>Your Trusted Investment Partner</h1>
    <p>Building Wealth Through Expert Financial Management.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     2. WHO WE ARE SECTION
============================================================ -->
<section class="section about-intro-section">
  <h2>Who Are We</h2>
  <div class="about-intro-split">
    <div class="about-intro-text">
      <p>We are a non-banking financial company established in 2008 to provide comprehensive financial services in the Nigerian financial sector with a focus on investment management and financial advisory services. We are staffed with a group of highly trained professionals with over 100 years of combined experience in financial advisory and asset management services.</p>

      <p>We are a wholly owned Nigerian company dedicated to delivering innovative financial services that empower the country's business landscape, catering to the needs of both individuals and corporations. Our identity is rooted in being an exceptional, all-encompassing financial hub where limitless possibilities flourish through our dedicated team and robust tools.</p>

      <p>The organisation is committed to operating as a professional and ethical organisation with an unmatched commitment to customer satisfaction.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-intro-image-wrapper">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="STI Assets Management corporate office" class="about-intro-img">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

